    LLM: 'Follow suit and trump when required. Lead low trumps to signal holding skiz or luna; lead high trumps (X or above) to show you lack the top two.\n\nCount card points and trumps. In bidding, assess hand strength for doi versus solo. As declarer, choose talon level to balance gain versus loss multiplier.\n\nSignal to partner via trump leads. Announce pagat ultimo or rege ultimo when hand supports it. Use contra strategically to double stakes.',
